8	/**
9	 * Establishes a new owner's effective registration date: the date supplied in the request, or the
10	 * server's current date when the request omits it. The effective date must fall on a business day,
11	 * so a Saturday or Sunday — whether supplied or defaulted — rolls forward to the next Monday (see
12	 * {@link BusinessDay}). Runs after {@link BuildOwner} maps the request and before
13	 * {@link AssignOwnerMembershipNumber} (which derives its year segment from this value) and
14	 * {@link SaveOwner} persists it.
15	 */
16	public class DefaultOwnerRegistrationDate {
